gging what goes to 4.5 after 4.4 is released, so don't expect much activity until the release of 4.4.\r\n\r\nOther than that, I can confirm that the multi-selection is preserved after clicking on the aforementioned buttons now :)\r\n\r\nMaybe one more thing would be to preserve the selection when the user click on another node and then come back to the Gridmap. But it could be another PR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2642496531/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647413766","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101942#issuecomment-2647413766","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101942","id":2647413766,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dzFQG","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T09:27:53Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T09:27:53Z","body":"> Sadly even though I can read your code and give feedback, I don't think I can officially review and approve your code, as I am not a core developer.\r\n\r\nEveryone that has a PR already merged can review and also approve PRs with a grey checkmark.\r\n\r\nIt may not have the same weight as a green checkmark and review from a team member but is still good to know when people have spend some time actually testing and reviewing a PR, especially when they have already worked in that area and have some expertise on the reviewed topic. Helps people like me to approve things when we only have time to look at things at a glance but not time for an in-depth review.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647413766/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2767380060","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101942#issuecomment-2767380060","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101942","id":2767380060,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k8t5c","user":{"login":"jamesmintram","id":108040,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODA0MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108040?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesmintram","html_url":"https://github.com/jamesmintram","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesmintram/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesmintram/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesmintram/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesmintram/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesmintram/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesmintram/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesmintram/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesmintram/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesmintram/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T20:56:42Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T20:56:42Z","body":"> I don't see any approve button with a grey checkmark on my side. But here is a first attempt at reviewing.\r\n> \r\n> Work as intended, but the code is introducing a distinction between the id of the selected item in the palette (i.e. `selected_mesh_palette_idx`) and its id in the mesh library (i.e. `selected_library_item_id`).\r\n> \r\n> This means that the two variables have to be synced. Although @jamesmintram added functions to set their values and keep them in sync, I am a bit concerned that it could introduce bugs in the future as new developers may not know they should use these functions.\r\n> \r\n> Is there a way to only rely on only one id and convert it only when needed?\r\n\r\nSorry, missed this feedback.\r\n\r\nYes, the distinction was always there and I believe it worked by accident - ie the 0th index of one equated to that 0th index of the other. I seem to remember I could create bugs due to this, but even if not - it is brittle relying on this equality without having it constrained. \r\nThe naming + added functions were introduced to help me unpick the distinction between them and make it easier to follow - as I think the original code got mixed up in places (but worked because they were often the same) I believe this was also done to help pave the way for adding multiple mesh palettes.\r\n\r\nIn any case, there is a non-obvious and non-trivial mapping between items and palette indexes which I think should be made as explicit as possible.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2767380060/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3061434359","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101942#issuecomment-3061434359","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101942","id":3061434359,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62ecf3","user":{"login":"Nodragem","id":10520249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTIwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10520249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem","html_url":"https://github.com/Nodragem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-11T09:17:41Z","updated_at":"2025-07-11T09:17:41Z","body":"@jamesmintram Hello, I know how frustrating it can be to have a PR blocked into review!\r\n\r\nYou have been very ambitious with this PR and really tried to make the code more readable while bringing this new feature.\r\n\r\nHowever, it would be easier for this feature to be reviewed and accepted if you split this PR in two:\r\n- 1) code that adds the feature with as less renaming/refactor as possible\r\n- 2) code that tackles the renaming and refactor (`mesh_library` and `mesh_palette`, `selected_mesh_palette_idx` and `selected_library_item_id`)\r\n\r\nThis way we can split the discussion about UI/tool design and the discussion about code/refactor. \r\n\r\nLet me know if are still interested in getting this PR across the line 😃, otherwise I will happily try to build upon your work 🚀 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3061434359/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]